"随你自在运动。","03 / UNDERSTAND":"03 / 洞察","Your body has a story.":"身体的变化，","Make sense of it.":"值得被理解。","NOOR brings sleep, health and activity together in the app. AI health insights help turn your daily data into a more personal perspective.":"NOOR App 汇集睡眠、健康与活动数据。AI 健康洞察让日常指标更清晰，帮助你从个人视角了解身体状态。","Personal health trends":"个人健康趋势","Daily activity overview":"每日活动概览","NOOR app health overview beside a gold NOOR Ring":"NOOR App 健康概览与金色 NOOR Ring","QUIETLY CAPABLE":"安静陪伴，功能出众","Wellness, in the details.":"健康，藏在细节里。","PLANNED APP FEATURE":"规划中的 APP 功能","Qibla compass":"礼拜方向指南针","Find your direction with location-based guidance in the NOOR app.":"通过 NOOR App 的定位与指南针功能，找到礼拜方向。","Prayer reminders":"礼拜时间提醒","Keep meaningful moments in your day with adjustable app reminders.":"在 App 内设置个性化提醒，留住每天重要的时刻。","* Product brochure specifications. Weight is for size 7; final production specifications and care instructions are subject to confirmation. Health data is for general wellness reference.":"* 参数来自产品资料，重量对应 7 号尺码。量产规格和使用说明以最终确认版本为准。健康数据仅供日常参考。","SEE IT UP CLOSE":"近距离认识 NOOR","A small ring.":"一枚小小的戒指。","A thoughtful experience.":"一份用心的体验。","Inside the ring":"探索戒指内部","Close-up of the sensors inside NOOR Ring":"NOOR Ring 内部传感器特写","Designed to feel like less":"轻盈设计，近乎无感","Black NOOR Ring product film":"黑色 NOOR Ring 产品视频","BE PART OF THE BEGINNING":"一起开启 NOOR 的旅程","Your NOOR.":"你的 NOOR。","Your early access.":"你的早鸟专享。","EARLY BIRD PRICE":"早鸟价","Retail price":"零售价","Reserve with":"预付定金","Reserve your place":"锁定早鸟资格","Choose your preferred finish and reserve with a $30 deposit to unlock the $199 early bird price.":"选择喜欢的配色，预付 199 元人民币定金，锁定 1,399 元人民币早鸟价。","Find your perfect fit":"找到舒适尺码","Confirm your ring size before your final order. Sizing kit details to follow.":"最终下单前确认尺码，试戴套件详情将另行公布。","Get ready for launch":"等待发售通知","Receive delivery details and your final order invitation at launch.":"发售时获取配送信息与最终下单邀请。","NOOR RING PRICING":"NOOR RING 定价",Price:"价格",Offer:"购买方式","Early bird":"早鸟价"